==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|anglerfish|anglerfishes}}

# Any fish of the bony fish order [[Lophiiformes]]. These fish use an outgrowth that can be wiggled so as to resemble a prey animal to lure and catch their prey.

